  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "R08 holds; Linkage is the only adverse family. The home-address exception does not apply because the registered address lacks the required tenure. No other rule holds, and no earlier outcome settles the order. Under §6.6(b), Linkage required id_check; that check passed, so §5.3(a) now requires clear and prohibits further hold, decline or escalation. Household sharing is the strongest benign explanation. The check establishes account identity and card possession, not repayment intent or the absence of every possible fraud pattern. No further check is required."
